              answer:
                'The term "Q4 2025" refers to the fourth quarter of the year 2025, which is a three-month period used in a company\'s fiscal calendar for reporting earnings and business performance. It typically covers October, November, and December of 2025, assuming the fiscal year aligns with the calendar year. Companies use these quarters to track financial results and developments over time, issuing quarterly reports for each period (Q1, Q2, Q3, and Q4)[1].',
